    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rɔal kä Thɛ-tha-lo-ni-ka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kɔr kä, mëë ci Puɔl kɛnɛ Thay-läth rët kɛ Am-pi-po-lɛth kɛnɛ A-po-lo-nia, cukɛ ben kä Thɛ-tha-lo-ni-ka, in tekɛ gua̱a̱th palä ji̱ Juudh thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Puɔl wä rɛc guäth palä, ce̱tkɛ ciaaŋdɛ, kä kɛ cäŋ lɔ̱ŋni da̱ŋ diɔ̱k, cuɛ ŋaknɔm ŋak kɛ kɛ kɛ kui̱ ruaacni Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ la̱t luɔt ruaacni Kuɔth kɛnɛ thuɔ̱kdiɛn ɛn ɣöö bi Mɛ-thia cuuc kä bɛ rɔ jiɛc li̱th. Kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Ɛn Yecu ɛ, la̱tdä yɛ ɛ, ɛ jɛn Mɛ-thia.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn ɛ nhɔk, kä cukɛ rɔ̱ ma̱t Puɔl kɛnɛ Thay-läth, ce̱tkɛ mëë ca la̱t ɛ ji̱ Gɛ-rith ti ŋuan ti palkɛ Kuoth amäni män ti bööth ti ŋuan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö cu ji̱ Juudh tekɛ tiɛɛl, kä cukɛ tha̱a̱ŋ wutni ti ji̱ nyuɔɔni dol guäth ko̱kä, kä cukɛ wec jakä rɔal. Cukɛ dhɔr Je-thon mak, görkɛ Puɔl kɛnɛ Thay-läth kɛ ɣöö dëëkɛ nööŋ raar nhiam nath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë /ka̱n kɛ jek ɛ kɛn, cukɛ Je-thon kɛnɛ tha̱a̱ŋ ji̱ ŋäthä yɔ̱a̱c nhiam kua̱ri ji̱ wec, wäkɛ i̱, “Kɛn wutni ti̱ti̱ tin ca ɣɔw bup kɛ nyuɔɔn cikɛ ben ɛn wanɛ mɛ bä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä ci Je-thon kɛ nyuɔ̱ɔ̱r. Kä lät kɛn diaal ni ti gua̱c kɛ ŋuɔ̱t Thii-thɛr, larkɛ jɛ ɛ kɛn, i̱ tëëkɛ Kuäär mi dɔ̱diɛn mi cɔali Yecu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu naath kɛ kua̱r wec diɛɛr mëë cikɛ nɛmɛ liŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cikɛ ti luɛ̈lkɛ nikɛ jek kä Je-thon kɛnɛ nɛy tin kɔ̱kiɛn, cua kɛ jakä wä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Puɔl kɛnɛ Thay-läth kä Bɛ-ria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikɛ jɛn wäär ɛmɔ cu ji̱ ŋäthä Puɔl kɛnɛ Thay-läth jäkä Bɛ-ria. Kä mëë cikɛ cop cukɛ wä gua̱a̱th palä ji̱ Juudh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn ji̱ Juudh ti̱ti̱ gɔaa ni ciaaŋdiɛn kä ji̱ Thɛ-tha-lo-ni-ka, kɛ ɣöö cikɛ ruac Kuɔth liŋ kɛ di̱t lɔaac, kä görkɛ ruaacni Kuɔth ni ciaŋ, kɛ ɣöö ba jɛ jek mi kɛn ti ca lat ɛ Puɔl ti kɛ thuɔ̱ɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy ti ŋuan ŋa̱th kä kɛ, kɛ män ji̱ Gɛ-rith ti ŋuan ti luɔ̱thkɛ amäni wutni Gɛ-rith ti ŋuan cukɛ ŋa̱th bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ji̱ Juudh tëë te kä Thɛ-tha-lo-ni-ka jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ca ruac Kuɔth lat ɛ Puɔl kä Bɛ-ria bä, cukɛ ben ɛn wänɛ mɛ kɛ ɣöö bikɛ buɔ̱n jakä rɔal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ni ɛn guäth ɛmɔ cu ji̱ ŋäthä Puɔl jäkä thok waath, kä duundɛ ɣöö cu Thay-läth kɛnɛ Ti-mo-thi duɔth ɛn wa̱nɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu nɛy tëë namkɛ Puɔl jɛ nööŋ nikä A-thɛn, cukɛ rɔ̱ ri̱t kä no̱o̱p Puɔl kɛ ɛn ɣöö dee Thay-läth kɛnɛ Ti-mo-thi ben kä jɛ kɛ pɛ̈th, mi lotdɛ rɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Puɔl kä A-thɛn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë lip Puɔl kɛ kä A-thɛn, cu lɔcdɛ jiääk mëë cɛ jɛ nɛn ɛn ɣöö ci wec thia̱a̱ŋ kɛ kuth jiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛnɔ cuɛ ŋaknɔm ŋak guäth palä kɛ ji̱ Juudh kɛnɛ Jur tin ca rɔ̱ ka̱m Kuoth, kä la ŋakɛ ŋaknɔmni guäth ko̱kä ni ciaŋ kɛnɛ nɛy tɔ̱ te wanɛ mɔ tɔ̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu tha̱a̱ŋ ŋi̱eecni tin guɔ̱ɔ̱rkɛ ŋi̱i̱c Ɛpi-ku-ruth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɛpi-ku-ruth",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kɛ nɛy ti ŋäth kɛ ɣöö tɛ̈th lɔaac min la ca̱r wec, ɛ jɛn la pek teekä mɔ.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kɛnɛ nɛy tin guɔ̱ɔ̱rkɛ ŋi̱i̱c in cɔali Thɛ-to-ik",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Thɛ-to-ik",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kɛ nɛy ti ŋa̱th kɛ ɣöö tëk ɛ mi thil tɛ̈th lɔaac kiɛ jiath lɔaac. Tëk ɛ mi te nɔ.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ŋaknɔm ŋak kɛ jɛ. Cu tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn wee i̱, “Ɛŋu mi go̱o̱r ram ɛ kui̱c ŋu ɛ jɛ i̱ bɛ lat?” Cu nɛy ti kɔ̱kiɛn ɛ loc i̱, “Ce̱tdɛ kɛ mi lätdɛ ni naath kuth kɔ̱kiɛn.” (Kä nɛmɛ ɛ ɣöö ci Puɔl kɛ la̱t thuk ti gɔw kɛ kui̱ Yecu kɛnɛ jiëcdɛ li̱th.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ Puɔl ka̱n, kä cukɛ jɛ nööŋ guäth mi cɔal i̱ A-ri-ɔ-pa-gäth, kä cukɛ thiec jɛ i̱, “Görkɔ ɣöö bakɔ ŋi̱i̱c in pay i̱ nööŋ min kämi naath ŋa̱c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö tha̱a̱ŋ ŋɔaani tin liɛŋkɔ tin latdi ga̱ykɛ kɔ, kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ görkɔ ɣöö bakɔ luɔtdɛ ŋa̱c.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱ A-thɛn diaal kɛnɛ Jur ti cieŋ thi̱n thilɛ mi latkɛ ɛ ni lat kɛnɛ li̱eŋ kä mi pay tuɔɔk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛnɔ cu Puɔl rɔ cuŋ nhiam nath kä A-ri-ɔ-pa-gäth wëë i̱, “Yɛn ji̱ A-thɛn, cä nɛn kɛ dup ti ŋuan ɛn ɣöö ta̱yɛ kɛ ciaaŋ kuoothä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö min ja̱a̱lä rɛy wec kä guɛcä tin pal yɛn kɛ, rɛydiɛn cua yi̱k jek mi ca gɔ̱r i̱, ‘Duŋ kuɔth mi /ca ŋäc.’ Kä ɛn min palɛ kä /cia ŋäc, ɛ jɛn la̱tdä yɛ mɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuoth in ci ɣɔw cak kɛnɛ ti diaal tin te rɛydɛ min la Kuäär nhial kɛnɛ piny, /cɛ cieŋ rɛy lueekni palä ti la̱tkɛ ɛ naath kɛ tetkiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /ca jɛ lätikä kɛ tet nath, ce̱tkɛ mi tëëkɛ mi go̱o̱rɛ. Kä jɛn puɔ̱nydɛ ɛ jɛn käm nɛy diaal tëk ɔ, kɛnɛ yiëë kɛ ŋɔaani diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ni kä ram kɛl cɛ döör diaal cak kɛ ɣöö bikɛ cieŋ wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n kɛɛliw. Kä cu puɔ̱nydɛ jɛ car ɛ nɛy kä ɛ wi̱ni ɛnɔ bikɛ cieŋ thi̱n ɔ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ ɣöö bikɛ Kuoth go̱r, kä dɔ̱ŋ bikɛ jɛ jek mi cikɛ jɛ go̱r, a cäŋ ni mɔ /cɛ na̱n kɛ ramɔ kä kɔn ɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ‘Rɛydɛ, ciëŋnɛ kä ja̱lnɛ, kä tëknɛ thi̱n.’ Ce̱tkɛ min ci tha̱a̱ŋ ca̱a̱kni dinkun ɛ lar i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
