        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ca ruac jiecä li̱th liŋ, cu tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn ɛ buy. Kä duundɛ ɣöö cu tin kɔ̱ŋ wee i̱, “Bakɔ ji̱ nyɔk kɛ li̱eŋ, kɛ kui̱ kä mɛmɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛnɔ cu Puɔl kɛ ba̱ny piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö cu tha̱a̱ŋ nath rɔ̱ ma̱t jɛ, kä cukɛ ŋa̱th, te rɛydiɛn kɛ Day-o-nii-thiäth raan A-ri-ɔ-pa-gäth, kɛ ciek mi cɔal i̱ Da-ma-rith, amäni nɛy kɔ̱kiɛn kɛɛl kɛ kɛ.",
          "type": "text",
